  "description": "*“This town is a beehive.”* \n\nA small, isolated, backward mountain town where everyone is born, raised, and lives together all their lives. A boy named Han Woo-bin, who has been bullied since childhood, his whole life. Woo-Bin’s only hope is to save up money and escape from this town as soon as possible. However, the bigger the spark of hope grows, paradoxically, the bigger the tragedy becomes..\n\n(Source: Namu Wiki, translated)",
